{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turnout</strong>\u00a0was primarily inspired by great games like <strong>Five Nights at Freddy's</strong> and <strong>FLATHEAD</strong>.<br>The game will require you to be focused and quick with your actions and thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The train won't stop and can't be stopped. You don't really have that much time left. Someone's going to end up being on the wrong track.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PICK A NUMBER,\u00a0ADJUST THE ROUTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The server will pick a number, you and your opponent will have to guess it, closest player's pick wins, and their route adjustment will be accepted.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rely on your luck or use the information provided to you to come up with strategies (for a lack of the former).</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COUNTER VIRUS ATTACKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Random virus attacks might end your game early if you don\u2019t pay enough attention to them.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNSTABLE VOLTAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Frequent power outages will leave you in limbo temporarily - better be quick with your actions.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUNDS FROM THE DEPTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An &lt;entity&gt; tries to join the game to remove one of the players - don't be that player.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049020?t=1757329005","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049020?t=1757329005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049020/e680aaf165cbb5cc278ea953efab4621d9074c73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757329005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049020/e680aaf165cbb5cc278ea953efab4621d9074c73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=175732900